黄庭坚","text":"障羞半面依篁竹，随意淡妆窥野塘。\n飘泊风尘少滋味，一枝犹傍故人香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":71897,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梦李白诵竹枝词三叠 其一","author":"黄庭坚","text":"一声望帝花片飞，万里明妃雪打围。\n马上胡儿那解听，琵琶应道不如归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":71898,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梦李白诵竹枝词三叠 其三","author":"黄庭坚","text":"命轻人鲊瓮头船，日瘦鬼门关外天。\n北人堕泪南人笑，青壁无梯闻杜鹃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":71899,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梨花","author":"黄庭坚","text":"巧解逢人笑，还能乱蝶飞。\n清风时入户，几片落新衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":71900,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"欸乃歌二章戏王稚川 其二","author":"黄庭坚","text":"从师学道鱼千里，盖世成功黍一炊。\n日日倚门人不见，看尽林乌反哺儿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":71901,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"萧子云宅","author":"黄庭坚","text":"郁木坑头春鸟呼，云迷帝子在时居。\n风流扫地无寻处，只有寒藤学草书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":71902,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鄂州南楼书事四首 其四","author":"黄庭坚","text":"武昌参佐幕中画，我亦来追六月凉。\n老子平生殊不浅，诸君少住对胡床。","collectio